  id: floressa
  dexNumber: 56
  displayName: Floressa
  lore: Grown, not born. Her gown is living petals, her slippers are furled leaves
    and her hair is a waterfall of vines. Gardens bloom where she has walked.
  personality: Graceful, curious about people, hums to seedlings.
